    <h1 style="color:#2c3e50; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:20pt; border-bottom:2px solid #34495e; padding-bottom:6px; margin-top:24px;">Project Report: HomeForge AI - Premium Web-Based 2D/3D Floor Plan Editor & Interior Decorator</h1>
